      "math_academy_id": "q-43057",
      "problem": "Which of the following determinants are equal to $0?$\n\n$$\n|A|=|\\begin{aligned}3 & 0 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{3} & -6 & 0 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} & 8 & 2\\end{aligned}|,\\,|B|=|\\begin{aligned}1 & \\sqrt{2} & 4 \\\\ 2 & 2\\sqrt{2} & 8 \\\\ 0 & -\\sqrt{3} & 4\\end{aligned}|,\\,|C|=|\\begin{aligned}-1 & \\sqrt{3} & 4 \\\\ 0 & 3 & \\sqrt{3} \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{aligned}|.\n$$",
